hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15516","Azhar ibn al-Qasim al-Rasibi narrated to us: Zakariyya ibn Ishaq narrated to us, from al-Walid ibn Abdullah ibn Shumaylah, from Abu Tarif, he said: I was with the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) when he besieged al-Taif, and he used to lead us in the Asr prayer, so that if a man shot an arrow, he could see the landing-place of his arrow."
